{:itonami.blueprint/id "cloud-itonami-isic-0115"
 :itonami.blueprint/name "Tobacco-Growing Operations Coordination"
 :itonami.blueprint/isic-rev5 "0115"
 :itonami.blueprint/domain :agriculture/tobacco-growing
 :itonami.blueprint/license "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
 :itonami.blueprint/social-impact [:food-security :rural-employment :environmental-stewardship]
 :itonami.blueprint/governor :tobacco-operations-governor
 :itonami.blueprint/robotics true
 :itonami.blueprint/required-technologies [:robotics :identity :forms :dmn :bpmn :audit-ledger :telemetry]
 :itonami.blueprint/optional-technologies []
 :itonami.blueprint/status :public-oss
 :itonami.blueprint/maturity :implemented
 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "TobaccoOpsAdvisor ⊣ Tobacco Operations Governor, langgraph-clj
 StateGraph (langgraph.graph, tobaccoops.operation/build), append-only
 audit ledger (tobaccoops.store/ledger + append-ledger!, MemStore and a
 DatomicStore backed by langchain.db via langchain-store.core). Fixes a
 prior gap: `deps.edn` declared `io.github.kotoba-lang/langgraph` only
 under the never-invoked `:dev :override-deps` alias (override-deps
 overrides an *existing* :deps entry -- with an empty :deps map it added
 nothing to the real build/run path) and `tobaccoops.operation`'s own
 docstring admitted it was 'a synchronous stub of this flow' that never
 required `langgraph.graph` -- zero use of `state-graph`/`add-node`/
 `compile-graph` anywhere in the file. Now: a genuinely compiled
 StateGraph (`:intake -> :advise -> :govern -> :decide -+->
 :commit / :request-approval -> :commit / :hold`) with
 `interrupt-before #{:request-approval}` + in-memory checkpointer for
 real human-in-the-loop resume. A back-office OPERATIONS COORDINATION
 actor for tobacco-growing field management -- not direct
 field-equipment operation authority and not curing-barn-temperature- or
 pesticide-application-decision authority. Four ops
 (`:log-cultivation-record` / `:schedule-field-operation` /
 `:flag-crop-health-concern` / `:order-supplies`), all `:effect
 :propose` only. Six HARD invariants (field-not-registered,
 no-execution, equipment-or-curing-decision-blocked, op-not-allowed,
 cultivation-record-invalid, leaf-grade-invalid) plus independent
 cost/acreage/leaf-grade/confidence verification (`tobaccoops.registry`)
 elaborate this blueprint's Governor. Crop-health-concern flagging
 ALWAYS escalates to a human farmer/agronomist via the compiled graph's
 `:request-approval` node (`interrupt-before`, checkpoint-based resume,
 proven by `test/tobaccoops/operation_test.cljc` exercising commit /
 hard-hold (unregistered field) / escalate-approve / escalate-reject /
 phase-0-forces-escalation through the REAL compiled graph end to end,
 plus a `clojure -M:dev:run` demo runner producing real ledger entries
 for every scenario). MemStore and DatomicStore pass the same
 store-contract test (`test/tobaccoops/store_contract_test.cljc`). 43
 tests / 162 assertions green (`clojure -M:dev:test`), clj-kondo 0
 errors, demo runnable end-to-end against both Store backends
 (`clojure -M:dev:run`). Governance-doc set and `docs/` were already
 present; CI (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`, sibling-checkout pattern for
 :local/root deps) was missing and is added in this fix."}
